<title>UK: Chelsea says Bates has unanimous support.</title>
<headline>Chelsea says Bates has unanimous support.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chelsea Village Plc, owner of Chelsea Football Club, said on Tuesday that Ken Bates has the unanimous support of the board as chairman.</p>
<p>It said it was making the statement in response to recent press speculation.</p>
<p>Bates said last week that the future of the club was assured despite the death of multi-millionaire backer and vice-chairman Matthew Harding in a helicopter crash.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
